  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Removing Barriers, Improving Access to Women&#x2019;s and Girls&#x2019; SRHR . Guat.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to improve access to safe abortion and other sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) for women, girls and LBT+ (Lesbian, Bisexual and Transgender+). The programme encompasses community mobilisation, awareness raising and training; provision of, contraception, counselling, and safe abortion services; capacity building for health personnel; comprehensive sexuality education; and strengthened advocacy efforts and litigation to remove SRHR restrictions.</narrative>
  </description>
